{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Famous Artists"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Claim to Fame"}, {"type": "position", "content": 11}, {"type": "origin", "content": "scholar > Looking to the Stars > Charlie Chaplin"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 6}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use important information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le06ob11re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Present Perfect Tense vs. The Simple Past Tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Present Perfect tense to talk about a finished action or event that is connected to the present in some way. </p>  You use the Simple Past tense to talk about a finished action or event <span class=\"strong\">not</span> necessarily connected to the present."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use the Present Perfect tense to talk about experience. When you use the Present Perfect tense, you think about the past and present together. There is some connection between what happened in the past and now. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:</br> <span class=\"italic\">I have learned English</span> = I learned English in the past and now I can speak English.</br> <span class=\"italic\">He has bought a painting</span> = He bought the painting in the past and now he has a painting. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "We use <span class=\"strong\">have/has</span> + <span class=\"strong\">the past participle</span> of the verb in Present Perfect sentences."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use the contracted form when speaking:</br> I have = I've</br> She has = She's</br> He has = He's </br>They have = They've</br> We have = We've</br> You have = You've"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find a list of verbs and their past participle forms. Memorize as many as you can."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Have you ever had a social network account?</br> <span class=\"strong\">Ben</span>: Yes, I have.</br> <span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Me, too!</br> <span class=\"strong\">Ben</span>: I've had mine for a long time.</br> <span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Cool!"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Describing Personality and Behavior"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use adjectives and adverbs to describe a person's personality and behavior."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You describe personality when you say how a person usually is. It is true most of the time. You use the verb to be + adjectives.</p> You describe behavior when you say what a person does or how a person is at a particular time. You use the verb to be + adjectives or expressions like <span class=\"italic\">you were acting ... </span> or <span class=\"italic\">you behaved</span> + adverb."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you want to be famous, you have to be unique!"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Describing Personality\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Describing Behavior\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"unique</br> attention-grabbing</br> offbeat </br>larger-than-life </br>eccentric </br>imaginative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"She was ... yesterday</br> I/you/he behaved ... + adverb\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "world-famous"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "famous around the world"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Facebook is a world-famous site."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le06ob11aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words to review."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "n